errors_directives.lyr:3:11: server:defer only works on .lyr components
errors_directives.lyr:4:7: server:defer takes no value
errors_directives.lyr:7:3: only slot="fallback" content is allowed inside a server:defer component
errors_directives.lyr:8:3: only slot="fallback" content is allowed inside a server:defer component
