errors_directives.lyr:13:6: client:visible only works on .lyr components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.lyr:14:7: client:idle only works on .lyr components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.lyr:15:11: client:load only works on .lyr components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.lyr:16:7: client:visible takes a static string value, not an expression
errors_directives.lyr:17:7: client:media takes a static string value, not an expression
errors_directives.lyr:18:7: client:idle takes no value
errors_directives.lyr:19:7: client:load takes no value
errors_directives.lyr:20:7: client:media needs a media query, e.g. client:media="(max-width: 600px)"
errors_directives.lyr:21:7: client:media needs a media query, e.g. client:media="(max-width: 600px)"
errors_directives.lyr:22:19: only one client:* directive is allowed per component
errors_directives.lyr:23:7: client:only is for framework components, which Lyr doesn't support; use client:load, client:idle, client:visible or client:media
errors_directives.lyr:24:7: unknown directive "client:hover" (client directives: client:load, client:idle, client:visible, client:media)
errors_directives.lyr:25:7: unknown directive "server:lazy" (server directives: server:defer, server:concurrent)
errors_directives.lyr:26:7: server:defer and client:* can't be combined; put client:* on a component inside the deferred one
errors_directives.lyr:27:7: server:defer and client:* can't be combined; put client:* on a component inside the deferred one
errors_directives.lyr:28:6: define:vars isn't supported; pass data with lyr.JSON on a data-* attribute, or set:json
errors_directives.lyr:29:6: unknown directive "set:foo" (set directives: set:html, set:text, set:json)
errors_directives.lyr:29:18: unknown directive "is:raw" (is directives: is:inline, is:global)
